    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d689">

                <pb facs="0955" n="875" xml:id="pg875"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.61248A/122</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Assistant Secretary of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Sayre</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the South African Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Close</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1936-12-19">December 19,
                        1936</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Minister</hi>: I wish to acknowledge
                    with thanks the receipt of your notes dated December 1 and December 15,
                        1936,<anchor n="16" xml:id="d689-f1"/> the former a recapitulation of
                    telegraphic exchanges with your government and the latter enclosing a copy of a
                    telegram informing us of the names of the Union Castle vessels which it is
                    proposed to equip for carrying grapes to Southampton in transit for New
                    York.</p>
                <p>I have conveyed all this information to appropriate officials in the Department
                    of Agriculture and I am informed that they are making their plans to send their
                    experts at the appropriate time.</p>
                <p>I am gratified that we have been able to make some progress in arriving at a
                    settlement of this question.</p>
                <p>Very sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi> B. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Sayre</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d689-f1" n="16" xml:id="d689-f1-content">
